WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.333 --> 00:00:01.917
Hey, have you ever noticed

2
00:00:01.958 --> 00:00:03.417
how much of life happens

3
00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:04.792
in conversation?

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.917
All day long,

5
00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:08.083
we're talking.

6
00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:08.833
At work,

7
00:00:08.875 --> 00:00:10.750
we decide what happens next.

8
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.792
At home,

9
00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:13.458
someone we love tells us

10
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.583
how their day really went.

11
00:00:16.708 --> 00:00:18.292
And on the way across town,

12
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:19.333
a call comes in,

13
00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:20.375
and we promise,

14
00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:21.667
"I'll take care of it."

15
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:23.958
You know that moment

16
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.333
at the doctor's?

17
00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:26.375
You nod, "got it,"

18
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:27.667
and by the parking lot,

19
00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:28.458
it's gone.

20
00:00:28.708 --> 00:00:30.375
Not because it didn't matter.

21
00:00:30.542 --> 00:00:31.875
Because one thing mattered

22
00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:33.083
more than the rest.

23
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.625
Life isn't made of conversations.

24
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.958
It's made of moments
worth remembering.

25
00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:40.042
That's what MEMRYA is for.

26
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:42.375
You choose when it listens.

27
00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:44.708
Afterward, you get a clear recap:

28
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:45.958
what was decided,

29
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.250
what was promised,

30
00:00:47.292 --> 00:00:48.583
what's still open.

31
00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:50.208
Share it as a PDF,

32
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.917
only when you say so.

33
00:00:52.083 --> 00:00:53.000
And when a question

34
00:00:53.042 --> 00:00:54.667
comes up later, just ask,

35
00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:56.042
and it takes you right back

36
00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.333
to where it was said.

37
00:00:57.542 --> 00:00:58.833
So you can stay present

38
00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:00.583
with the people you love.

39
00:01:00.792 --> 00:01:01.583
MEMRYA.

40
00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.417
Remember what matters.
